The material lightings are already lighting nodes, so they go straight into the list ahead of the batched light data nodes. The batching itself is untouched. I applied the same change to the 0.186.1 file and re-ran the repro: the sphere under `DynamicLighting` then matches the default lighting (mean luminance of the sphere region 175.1 in both, against 10.0 without the fix).

